# A sketch: "Without Hex" alone, played while the model downloads.

title   Family
group   Mom, Dad, Grandma, and you
boss    Mom coral
side    Dad blue
side    Grandma lilac
lead    The family wants an answer. One quick reply by hand.

Mom: Who's bringing what on Sunday?

start
Mom: you're still doing the pie? [0.35]
type    yes!! pecan [panic 0.25-0.4]
send
tap     ❤ 0.4
wait    0.3

Dad: and the folding chairs? [0.35]
elbow
type    ILL BRING EVERYTHING [panic 0.55-0.7]
send    meant i'll bring everything
wait    0.2

Grandma: WHY ARE WE YELLING [0.3]
Dad: nobody's yelling mom [0.3]
Mom: honey, your caps lock [0.4]
type    WHAT [panic 0.8]
send    meant what?
wait    0.3

Grandma: DON'T TAKE THAT TONE WITH ME [0.4]
type    SORRY GRANDMA [panic 0.9]
send    meant sorry grandma
tap     ‼ 0.3
wait    0.6

Grandma: THAT'S IT [0.8]
end     removed: Grandma removed you from “Family”
